+/**
+ * SECTION:gstavs2parser
+ * @title: GstAvs2Parser
+ * @short_description: Convenience library for parsing AVS2 video bitstreams.
+ *
+ * Parses the start code units, the sequence header and the picture headers
+ * of AVS2 (GB/T 33475.2, IEEE 1857.4) elementary streams.
+ *
+ * Since: 1.30
+ */
